<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">RRK46.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ABAROOMA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha Ei Paulo Yaahandiikiire Abarooma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abarooma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABAROOMA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:15">Byak 9:15</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:15">Gal 1:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe Paulo, omuhuuku wa Yesu Kristo, nkeetwa kuba entumwa, naashoroorerwa engiri ya Ruhanga, <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />ei yaaraganiise ira omu kanwa ka baanabi be omu Byahandiikirwe ebirikweta; <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:42">Mat 22:42</ref>. </char></note> engiri egyo niyo emanyisa eby'Omwana we owaazairwe omuri baijukuru ba Daudi omu mubiri, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:33">Byak 13:33</ref>. </char></note> kandi akoorekwa n'amaani ku ari Omwana wa Ruhanga ahabw'okuzooka omu bafu, nk'oku Omwoyo Orikwera yaaragwire, Ogwo niwe Yesu Kristo Mukama waitu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:7">Gal 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 2:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Niwe yaatuhaisize embabazi n'okuba entumwa ez'okureetera ab'omu mahanga goona okworobera okwikiriza ahabw'eiziina rye; <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />kandi naimwe muri omuri abo abaayetsirwe kuba aba Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Mbwenu imwe ab'omuri Rooma, abarikukundwa Ruhanga, kandi abaayetsirwe kuba abarikwera, naabahandiikira. Nimbendeza embabazi n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Tataitwe, na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Okubanza ninsiima Ruhanga wangye omuri Yesu Kristo ahabwanyu mwena, ahabw'okuba okwikiriza kwanyu nikugambwa omu nsi zoona. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:16">Efe 1:16</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga, ou mpeereza omu mutima gwangye omu ngiri n'Omwana we, niwe kareebi wangye orikuhamya ku mbaijuka obutoosha omu kushaba kwangye, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:23">Rom 15:23</ref>. </char></note> ngu, ku kiraabe nikibaasika hati ahabw'okukunda kwa Ruhanga, aha muheru gwa byona aikirize kundeeta n'obusingye, ampitsye owaanyu, <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />ahakuba mbainiire orushusho ngu mbone kubaha omugisha gw'Omwoyo, gubagumye; <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />nikwo kugira ngu tugumyane, nyowe ngumibwe okwikiriza kwanyu, naimwe okwangye. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />B'eishe-emwe, niinyenda ku mumanya ngu kaingi nkenda kwija owaanyu, ngu ndeebe n'omuriimwe ebyana, nk'oku naabireebire omu Banyamahanga abandi; kwonka hariho ebyanzibiire n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Abagriika n'ab'amahanga agandi, abanyabwengye n'abatabwine, mbaineho eibanja; <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />n'ahabw'ekyo nyowe ahabwangye ninkunda munonga kubabuurira engiri naimwe ab'omuri Rooma. <verse eid="ROM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:18">1 Kor 1:18</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 1:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba engiri terikunkwatsa nshoni, ahabw'okuba nigo maani ga Ruhanga, agahaisa orikwikiriza weena okujunwa, okubandiza aha Bayudaaya, kandi n'aha Bagriika. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Hab 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omu ngiri egyo okuhikiirira okurikuruga ahari Ruhanga nimwo kushuuruurirwa okuheebwa ahabw'okwikiriza, kukagumizamu omu kwikiriza, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Ohikiriire aryaba ohuriire ahabw'okwikiriza.<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abantu okusiisikara ahabw'okuruga ahari Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:10">Kur 32:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mumanye ngu ekiniga kya Ruhanga nikishuuruurwa okuruga omu iguru, nikiija kurwanisa okutatiina Ruhanga kwona n'okutahikiirira kw'abantu, abazindisa amazima okutahikiirira kwabo; <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />ahakuba ebirikubaasikira abantu kumanya ahari Ruhanga babishoborokyerwa, ahabw'okuba Ruhanga akabibashuuruurira. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:1">Zab 19:1</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aha kuhangwa kw'ensi ebya Ruhanga ebitareebwa eby'obushoboorozi bwe obutahwaho, n'obwaruhanga bwe, bikareebekyera kimwe, nibimanyirwa aha bi yaahangire; n'ahabw'ekyo tibaine ky'okwekwatsa; <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />ahakuba, n'obu baraabe baamanyire Ruhanga, kwonka tibaramuhimbiise nka Ruhanga, n'obu kwakuba okumusiima, bakahabisibwa ebiteekateeko byabo, n'emitima yaabo y'emishema yaashwekwa omwirima. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:20">1 Kor 1:20</ref>. </char></note> Ku baayeyetsire abanyabwengye, baahinduka ebifa-mutima; <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:20">Zab 106:20</ref>. </char></note> omu mwanya gw'ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga otafa baatamu ebishushani by'abantu abafa, n'eby'ebirikuguruka, n'eby'enyamaishwa, n'eby'ebirikugyendesa enda.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Nikyo Ruhanga yaabarekyeire kukurata ebi emitima yaabo erikwetenga, bakakora ebihagaro, bakashiisha oburungi bw'emibiri yaabo bonka na bonka; <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />ahakuba amazima ga Ruhanga bakagahindura ebishuba, baaramya ebyahangirwe, baabiheereza okukira Omuhangi orikusiimwa ebiro byona Amiina. <verse eid="ROM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />N'ahabw'ekyo Ruhanga akabareka, ngu bategyekwe emize erikwitsa enshoni; abakazi baabo baareka eki emibiri yaabo yaahangiirwe, baagikoresa ekitari ky'obuhangwa; <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9">1 Kor 6:9</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'abashaija nabo baareka kukorera abakazi eby'obuhangwa, baabugumwamu okurigira okubi, abashaija baakora eby'obuhemu aha bandi bashaija, baihurwa omu mibiri yaabo ebishemereire obuhabe bwabo.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kandi nk'oku baayangire kumanya Ruhanga omu mitima yaabo, Ruhanga nikyo yaabarekyeire kugira emitima etarikusiimwa, n'okukora ebitashemeire; <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />baijuriire kimwe okutahikiirira kwona, obubi, omururu, n'okwangana; baijwire n'eihari, obwitsi, n'entongane, obugobya, n'eitima; <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />n'abantu abahwihwitsa, n'abagambuura nibabeiha, abanga Ruhanga, abanyamaryo, abeemanya, abeekuza, abeecwera ebibi, abagomera abaabazaire, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />abateetegyereza, abaita endagaano, abatakunda bantu, abatasaasira. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Abo, n'obu bamanya orubanja oru Ruhanga acwera abakora nk'ebyo, ngu bashemereire kufa, tibabikora kwonka, kandi basiima n'ababikora.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okushinja Abayudaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:7">Yoh 8:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo otainiire ky'okwetonganira, iwe omuntu weena ocwera ondiijo orubanja; ahakuba omu kurumucwera, oba noorwesingisa; haza iwe orumucwera, ebi okora nibyo bimwe n'ebi akora. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Kandi nitumanya ngu orubanja, oru Ruhanga acwera abakora nk'ebyo, n'orw'amazima. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Iwe omuntu, ocwera abakora nk'ebyo orubanja, haza naiwe noobikora, nooteekateeka ngu oryakira orubanja rwa Ruhanga? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:15">2 Pet 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Nari noogaya obutungi bw'embabazi ze, n'obw'okugumisiriza kwe, n'obw'okwetwara kwe? Torikumanya ngu embabazi za Ruhanga ziba ez'okukuhitsya aha kweteisa? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Kwonka ahabw'omutima gwawe ogugangaire, oguteeteisa, oyebiikira ekiniga ekiribaho aha kiro ky'ekiniga, ahu Ruhanga arishuuruurira orubanja oruhikire; <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 24:12">Enf 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Kor 5:10</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba aryaihura omuntu weena ebishemereire ebi yaakozire. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Abasherura ekitiinisa n'okusiimwa n'okutafa, nibabisheruza okukora gye batarikuruha, aryabaihura amagara agatahwaho; <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:8">2 Tes 1:8</ref>. </char></note> kwonka abaine emitima y'empaka n'abatoorobera mazima, kureka aboorobera okutahikiirira, aryabaihura okuguubwa kubi n'ekiniga kingi, <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />n'okubonabonesibwa n'obusaasi; ebyo nibyo biriba aha muntu weena okora kubi, okubandiza aha Muyudaaya okuhika aha Mugriika; <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />kwonka oburungi n'ekitiinisa n'obusingye biryaba aha muntu weena okora gye, okubandiza aha Muyudaaya okuhika aha Mugriika; <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:17">1 Pet 1:17</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Ruhanga tashoroora mu bantu.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Abaakozire ebibi batarikumanya Biragiro, baryahwerekyerezibwa batarikuturwa Biragiro; kandi boona abaakozire ebibi nibamanya Ebiragiro, baryacwerwa orubanja omu Biragiro; <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:22">Yak 1:22</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 1:25">25</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba abahurira buhurizi Ebiragiro tibo bahikiriire omu maisho ga Ruhanga; kureka ababyorobera nibo baihwaho orubanja. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:35">Byak 10:35</ref>. </char></note> Abanyamahanga abataine Biragiro, ku baraabe bakora ebi ebiragiro biragiira ahabw'obuhangwa, biri baba beehindukiire ebiragiro, n'obu baraabe bataine Biragiro. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Booreka ngu eki Ebiragiro byetenga kihandiikirwe omu mitima yaabo, kihamibwa eiraka ry'omwoyo erituura omuribo, kandi kikwatanisa n'ebiteekateeko byabo kubashinja, nari kubatonganira; <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />kandi nikwo kiriba aha kiro eki Ruhanga aricweraho emanja z'ebi abantu baakozire omu mubonano, naazicwisa Yesu Kristo, nk'engiri ei naahwairwe oku egira.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuyudaaya ow'amazima oku ari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Kwonka iwe oyeyeta Omuyudaaya, okeegamira Ebiragiro, okeehimbisiza omuri Ruhanga, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />okamanya ebi akunda, okasiima ebirikukira oburungi ahabw'okwegyesibwa eby'omu Biragiro, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:9">Luk 18:9</ref>. </char></note> kandi okeehamya ku ori omwebembezi w'empumi, n'omushana gw'abari omu mwirima, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:5">2 Tim 3:5</ref>. </char></note> n'omuhabuzi w'abataine bwengye, n'omwegyesa w'abaana abato, ahabw'okuba omu Biragiro oine ebirikumanyisa obwengye n'amazima; <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />mbwenu iwe oyegyesa abandi, toyeyegeysa? Iwe obuurira abandi okutaiba, oiba? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Iwe ogira ngu omuntu tashemereire kushambana, oshambana? Iwe onuga ebishushani by'abacwezi, oiba eby'omuri hekalu zaabo? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Iwe oyehimbisiza omu Biragiro, kandi niiwe ogayisa Ruhanga omu kubishobya? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Isa 52:5</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Eiziina rya Ruhanga nirijumwa omu Banyamahanga ahabwanyu.<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />N'eky'amazima, okusharwa nikugasha, waaba noohitsya Ebiragiro; kwonka ku orikuba noobishobya, okusharwa kwawe nikuhinduka okutasharwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:6">Gal 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu otashazirwe, ku araabe naahitsya ebi Ebiragiro biragiira, okutasharwa kwe tikuribarwa nk'okusharwa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Otashazirwe mu mubiri, ku araabe naahitsya eby'omu Biragiro, tarikusingisa orubanja iwe orikushobya Ebiragiro, haza oine Ebyahandiikirwe kandi oshazirwe omu mubiri? <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:39">Yoh 8:39</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba Omuyudaaya ow'aharuguru kwonka tiwe Muyudaaya w'amazima, kandi okusharwa okw'aharuguru okw'omubiri tikwo kusharwa kw'amazima; <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:11">Kol 2:11</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Omuyudaaya ow'omu mutima niwe Muyudaaya, kandi okusharwa okw'omu mutima okw'omu mwoyo, kutari kw'omu bihandiiko, nikwo kusharwa; okusiimwa kw'omuntu ogwo tikuruga ha bantu, kureka ahari Ruhanga.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s1">Eki Abayudaaya bakiza abandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Omuyudaaya naakiza ki abandi? Nari shi okusharwa nikugasha ki? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:4">Rom 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:7">Bir 4:7</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 4:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Nibigasha munonga omu miringo yoona. Eky'okubanza, Abayudaaya nibo baakwatsiibwe ebyagambirwe Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:13">2 Tim 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu shi tugambe ki? N'obu abamwe bataraikiriize, okutaikiriza kwabo nikubaasa kuhindura okwesigwa kwa Ruhanga okuba busha? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Rubuuza! Ka tuhamye Ruhanga ku aba ow'amazima, n'obu omuntu weena yaakuba omunyabishuba, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">Obe ohikiriire omu bigambo byawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">Osingye, ku oraacwerwe orubanja.<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Okutahikiirira kwaitu ku kuraabe nikuhamya okuhikiirira kwa Ruhanga, tugambe ki? Tugire tuti: Ruhanga ku ahanisa ekiniga, aba atahikiriire? (Naagamba nk'oku abantu bagamba.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Rubuuza! Ku kiraabe kiri kityo, Ruhanga aryacwera ata ensi orubanja? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Ebishuba byangye ku biraabe nibimanyisa amazima ga Ruhanga, bikamuhaisa ekitiinisa, ahanki nyowe nicwerwa orubanja nk'omusiisi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Kandi n'enki ekirikutuzibira kukora ekibi, ngu ebirungi bibone kwoja? Nk'oku abamwe batubeiherera, bakahamya ngu nikwo tugamba. Abarikugira batyo baryacwerwa orubanja orubashemereire.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibi okuba aha bantu boona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:18-2:24">Rom 1:18—2:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu tugire tuta? Tuti, itwe Abayudaaya twine eki turikukiza abandi? Ngaaha, na kakye; ahakuba mperize kuhamya ngu abantu boona, Abayudaaya n'Abagriika, bategyekwa ekibi, <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Zab 14:1-3</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">Tihariho ohikiriire, tihariho n'omwe;<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Tihariho orikushoborokyerwa, tihariho orikusherura Ruhanga.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Boona bakahaba, boona hamwe baahinduka entakimazire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">Tihariho orikukora gye, tihariho n'omwe.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:9">Zab 5:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Emimiro yaabo n'ekituuro ekirangaire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Bagobya n'endimi zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Obushegu bw'encwera buri omu minwa yaabo;<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />Akanwa kaabo kaijwire okukyeena n'obushaarizi;<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:7">Isa 59:7</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 59:8">8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amaguru gaabo garahukira okusheesha eshagama;<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Okuhwerekyereza n'enaku biri omu mihanda yaabo,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />N'omuhanda gw'obusingye tibarikugumanya;<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />Tibata mutima aha kutiina Ruhanga.<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:22">Gal 3:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nitumanya ngu byona ebi Ebiragiro bigamba, bibigambira abo abu bitegyeka, ngu buri kanwa kabumbwe, kandi ab'ensi boona basingwe orubanja omu maisho ga Ruhanga; <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2:16</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omu maisho ge tihariho muntu n'omwe orisinga orubanja ahabw'okukora emirimo erikuragiirwa Ebiragiro; ahabw'okuba Ebiragiro nibyo bimanyisa ekibi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhikiirira okuheebwa ahabw'okwikiriza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Kwonka hati hariho okuhikiirira okushuurwirwe okuruga ahari Ruhanga, kutari kw'ebiragiro, haza Ebiragiro n'ebya baanabi nibikuhamya, <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />nikwo kuhikiirira kwa Ruhanga, oku abarikwikiriza boona baheebwa ahabw'okwikiriza Yesu Kristo. Mumanye ngu tihariho mutaano; <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />ahakuba boona bakashiisha, kandi tibarikuhika ha kitiinisa kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:8">Efe 2:8</ref>. </char></note> Kureka baihirwaho busha orubanja ahabw'embabazi ze, naabacunguza okucungurwa okuri omuri Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1:7</ref>. </char></note> Niwe Ruhanga yaataireho okuba ekarabo y'abarikwikiriza eshagama ye, ngu abone kworeka okuhikiirira kwe, okwamureeteire okwetsiza ebibi ebyakozirwe ira, ebi yaagumisiririize; <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />kandi ngu omu biro ebi ayorekye okuhikiirira kwe, abe Ohikiriire, kandi Oiha orubanja aha muntu weena orikwikiriza Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Mbwenu aho okwehimbisa kurahi? Tikuriho. Nikuzibirwa ki? Ahabw'emirimo? Ngaaha; kureka n'ahabw'okwikiriza. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ahakuba nituhamya ngu omuntu aihwaho orubanja ahabw'okwikiriza, tarwihwaho habw'okukora emirimo y'Ebiragiro. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:12">Rom 10:12</ref>. </char></note> Nari shi Ruhanga n'ow'Abayudaaya bonka? Ti Ruhanga w'Abanyamahanga nabo? Eego, n'ow'Abanyamahanga nabo; <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />ahakuba Ruhanga aba omwe; kandi niwe ariiha aha bashazirwe orubanja ahabw'okwikiriza, n'aha batashazirwe ahabw'okwikiriza. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:17">Mat 5:17</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu shi Ebiragiro nitubihindura busha ahabw'okwikiriza? Ngaaha! Tikwo kiri; nituhamya Ebiragiro.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu okwihwaho orubanja ahabw'okwikiriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Ku biraabe biri bityo, tugambe ki ahari Abrahamu, tatenkuriitwe omu mubiri, eki yaareebire? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ahabw'okuba Abrahamu, kuri yaihirweho orubanja ahabw'emirimo, akaagizire eky'okwehimbisizaho, kwonka takiine ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Kut 15:6</ref>. </char></note> Ebyahandiikirwe nibigira bita? Biti: Abrahamu akaikiriza Ruhanga, kyamubarirwa okuba okuhikiirira. <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:6">Rom 11:6</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu, okora omurimo, ebihembo bye tibibarwa nk'ekiconco kureka nk'enyihurano. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Kwonka otakora mirimo, akaikiriza Ogwo oiha orubanja aha batatiina Ruhanga, okwikiriza kwe kumubarirwa okuba okuhikiirira. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Nk'oku Daudi nawe yaagambire aha mugisha oguheebwa omuntu ou Ruhanga abarira okuhikiirira, okutari habw'okukora emirimo, ati:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:1">Zab 32:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 32:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baine omugisha abasaasiirwe eby'okushiisha byabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 4:7">N'ebibi byabo bikashwekwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Aine omugisha omuntu ou Mukama ataribarira kibi. <verse eid="ROM 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Mbwenu omugisha ogu gugambwa ahabashazirwe bonka, nari n'aha batashazirwe? Ahakuba twagira tuti: Okwikiriza kwa Abrahamu kukamubarirwa okuba okuhikiirira. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Kukamubarirwa ryari: Yaashazirwe, nari atakashazirwe? Tikuramubariirwe yaashazirwe, kureka atakashazirwe. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Kut 17:10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 17:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaaheebwa okusharwa okuba akamanyiso k'okuhamya okuhikiirira kwe kw'okwikiriza, oku yaabaire aine atakashazirwe, ngu abone kuba ishenkuru wa boona abaikiriza batashazirwe, ngu nabo babarirwe okuhikiirira; <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />kandi abe na ishenkuru w'abashazirwe, batari abafiire kusharwa kwonka, kureka abagyendera omu kwikiriza kwa tatenkuriitwe Abrahamu, oku yaabaire aine atakashazirwe. <verse eid="ROM 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Kut 22:18</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba endagaano ei Abrahamu n'abaijukuru baaraganisiibwe ku barihungura ensi, terarugire mu Biragiro, kureka omu kuhikiirira ahabw'okwikiriza. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Abeesiga Ebiragiro kuri nibo bahunguzi, okwikiriza kukaabaire okwa busha, n'ebyaraganisiibwe bikaabaire bifiire; <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:20">Rom 3:20</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Ebiragiro bireeta ekiniga; kwonka ahu Ebiragiro bitari tihariho kushobya.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo okuhikiirira kuruga omu kwikiriza, ngu ebyaraganisiibwe ebyo bibone kwegamira embabazi, kandi bihamibwe aha baijukuru boona, t'abarikwesiga Biragiro bonka, kureka nabo abarikugyendera omu kwikiriza kwa Abrahamu; ahabw'okuba niwe tatenkuriitwe twena; <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Kut 17:5</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Nkakugira ishenkuru w'amahanga maingi omu maisho g'Ogwo ou yaikiriize, niwe Ruhanga ozoora abafu, kandi oyeta ebitariho nk'ebiriho. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Abrahamu ogwo akaikiriza, yaagira amatsiko omu bunaku obu yaakugahwereiremu, ngu aryaba ishenkuru w'amahanga maingi, nk'oku kyagambirwe ngu: Abaijukuru nikwo bariba batyo. <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Kandi n'obu araabe yaareebire omubiri gwe nigushusha nk'ogufiire ahabw'okumara emyaka y'obukuru nka igana, akareeba na Saara yaabaire ekicura atakibaasa kuzaara, okwikiriza kwe tikuratentebukire; <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:11">Heb 11:11</ref>. </char></note> kureka, ku yaataire amaisho aha bi Ruhanga yaaraganiise, tiyaabanganisisibwa kutaikiriza, kureka yaagumibwa okwikiriza, yaahimbisa Ruhanga; <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />kandi yaamanyira kimwe ngu eki Ruhanga yaaraganiise, naabaasa kukikora. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Nikyo okwikiriza kwe kwamubariirwe okuba okuhikiirira. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Tikiramuhandiikiirwe wenka, ngu kikamubarirwa okuba okuhikiirira, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />kureka ahabwaitu naitwe abaribarirwa okuhikiirira, itwe abarikwikiriza Ogwo owaazoire Yesu Mukama waitu omu bafu; <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:17">1 Kor 15:17</ref>. </char></note> niwe yaahairweyo ahabw'eby'okushiisha byaitu, kandi akazoorwa kutwihaho orubanja.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Obusingye obw'abaihwaho orubanja ahabw'okwikiriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, twihirweho orubanja ahabw'okwikiriza, twine obusingye ahari Ruhanga ahabwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo; <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />kandi ahabw'Ogwo tureebire oburyo bw'okutaaha omu mbabazi ezi, ezi tuhamiiremu ahabw'okwikiriza, kandi nitwesiima twine amatsiko g'okureeba ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:2">Yak 1:2</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 1:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:5-7">1 Pet 1:5-7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi t'ekyo kyonka; kureka nitwesiimira n'omu busaasi, ahabw'okuba nitumanya ngu omu busaasi harugamu okugumisiriza, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />omu kugumisiriza harugamu okuhamibwa, n'omu kuhamibwa harugamu amatsiko; <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:18">Heb 6:18</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 6:19">19</ref>. </char></note> kandi amatsiko tigakwatsa nshoni, ahabw'okuba okukunda kwa Ruhanga kushukirwe omu mitima yaitu Omwoyo Orikwera ou twahairwe.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Ku twabaire tukiri enshoberwa, omu bunaku buhikire Kristo yaafeera abatatiina Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Nimumanya ku kigumire omuntu kufeera ohikiriire; nangwa shana akaayemera kufeera ow'emicwe mirungi; <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Yoh 3:16</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Ruhanga ayoreka okukunda kwe oku atukunda, ahakuba ku twabaire tukiri abanyabibi, Kristo yaatufeera. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:18">Rom 1:18</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu okukira munonga, nk'oku tuherize kwihwaho orubanja ahabw'eshagama ye, turyakira ekiniga kya Ruhanga ahabwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:7">Rom 8:7</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ku turaabe twagarukaine na Ruhanga ahabw'okufa kw'Omwana we tukiri abazigu be, mbwenu okukira munonga, nk'oku tuherize kugarukana nawe, amagara ge garyatukiza; <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />kandi t'ekyo kyonka, kureka nitushemerererwa omuri Ruhanga ahabwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, otuhaisize hati okugarukana oku.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukira orubanja rwa tatenkuriitwe Adamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 2:17">Kut 2:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, nk'oku ekibi kyaizire omu nsi ahabw'okushiisha kw'omuntu omwe, kandi kikarugamu okufa, nikwo n'okufa kwabugire omu bantu boona, ahakuba boona bakashiisha. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Nimumanya ngu Ebiragiro bitakatairweho, ekibi kikaba kiri omu nsi; kwonka ekibi tikibarirwa muntu ahu Ebiragiro bitari. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:22">1 Kor 15:22</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 15:45">45</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga ahari Adamu okuhika ahari Musa, okufa kukaba kutegyeka abantu, nangwa n'abatarasiisire nk'oku Adamu yaacumwire, kandi niwe kishushani ky'Ogwo owaabaire naayenda kwija. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Kwonka ekiconco ky'embabazi tikiine kakwate n'ekicumuro ekyo; ahakuba ekicumuro ky'omuntu omwe ku kiraabe kyareeteire abantu baingi okufa, okukira munonga embabazi za Ruhanga n'ekiconco ky'embabazi z'omuntu omwe Yesu Kristo nikwo byakanyire ahari baingi. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Kandi ekiconco ekyo eky'embabazi tikirikushushana n'ebyarugire aha kicumuro ky'omuntu ogwo omwe; ahakuba orubanja orwarugire aha kicumuro ekyo eky'omwe rukareeta okusingwa; kwonka ekiconco ky'embabazi, ekyaizire ahanyima y'ebicumuro bingi, kikareeta okurwihwaho. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ekicumuro ky'omuntu omwe ku kiraabe kyareeteire rufu okwema ahabw'ogwo, okukira munonga abaakiira ezo embabazi nyingi munonga n'ekiconco ky'okuhikiirira, baryayemekwa omu magara masya ahabw'omwe niwe Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Nk'oku ekicumuro ky'omuntu omwe kyasingiise abantu boona orubanja, nikwo n'eky'okuhikiirira, eki omuntu omwe yaakozire, kyahikire kityo aha bantu boona, ngu baihweho orubanja, baheebwe amagara. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ahakuba nk'oku baingi baahindukire abasiisi ahabw'okutahurira kw'omuntu omwe, nikwo baingi barihinduka abahikiriire ahabw'okuhurira kw'omwe. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:8">Rom 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:19">Gal 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ebiragiro nabyo bikaija, ngu ebicumuro bikanye; kwonka ei ekibi kyagarukiire kukanya, embabazi zikakiraho kukanya munonga, <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:23">Rom 6:23</ref>. </char></note> ngu, nk'oku ekibi kyategyekire kikareeta okufa, embabazi zibe nikwo zaategyekyesa okuhikiirira okuhitsya omu magara agatahwaho ahabwa Yesu Kristo Mukama waitu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Okutakora bibi ahabw'okwekwatsa embabazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Mbwenu tugambe ki? Tugume omu kibi, ngu embabazi zibone kukanya? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:1">1 Pet 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Nikikabure! Itwe abaaherize kufa aha kibi, nitubaasa tuta kukigarukamu, tukakigumamu? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Timurikumanya ngu itwe twena abaabatiziibwe kutaaha omuri Kristo Yesu, tukabatizibwa kutaaha omu kufa kwe? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Kol 2:12</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ahabw'okubatizibwa tukaziikwa nawe kutaaha omu kufa, nk'oku Kristo yaazookire omu bafu ahabw'amaani g'ekitiinisa kya Isheboona, naitwe tube nikwo twagyendera tutyo omu magara masya. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:10">Fil 3:10</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 3:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Ku turaabe twateeraine nawe ahabw'okushushanisibwa nawe omu kufa kwe, turyateerana nawe tutyo omu kuzooka nk'okwe. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:24">Gal 5:24</ref>. </char></note> Nitumanya ngu omuntu waitu owa ira akabambwa nawe, ngu omubiri gw'ekibi guhindurwe busha, itwe turekye kuguma nitutegyekwa ekibi; <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />ahakuba ofiire aba atakitegyekwa kibi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Kwonka ku turaabe twafiire hamwe na Kristo, nitwikiriza ngu turyamereera nawe; <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />ahabw'okuba nitumanya ngu, Kristo nk'oku yaazookire omu bafu, takigaruka kufa; okufa tikwakimutegyeka. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:26-28">Heb 9:26-28</ref>. </char></note> Okufa oku yaafiire, akafa rimwe aha kibi yaaheza; mbwenu amagara agu aine, againe ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:24">1 Pet 2:24</ref>. </char></note> Naimwe mwebare mutyo, ku mufiire aha kibi, kwonka ku muri abahuriire ahari Ruhanga omuri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />N'ahabw'ekyo mutaikiriza ekibi kutegyeka omu mibiri yaanyu ey'okufa, mukoorobera okurigira kwayo okubi; <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:1">Rom 12:1</ref>. </char></note> kandi mutaha ekibi engingo zaanyu kuzikoresa eby'okutahikiirira, kureka mweheereze Ruhanga nk'abahuriire abazoirwe kuruga omu bafu, kandi n'engingo zaanyu muzimuhe kuzikoresa eby'okuhikiirira. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ekibi tikiribategyeka, ahabw'okuba timurikutegyekwa Biragiro kureka embabazi.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Mbwenu shi, tukore ekibi, ngu ahabw'okuba titurikutegyekwa Biragiro kureka embabazi? Rubuuza! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:34">Yoh 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:19">2 Pet 2:19</ref>. </char></note> Timurikumanya ngu ogwo ou mweha nk'abahuuku kumuhurira, muba muri abahuuku b'ogwo ou muhurira, yaaba kibi ekireeta okufa, nari okuhurira okureeta okuhikiirira? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Kwonka Ruhanga asiimwe, ahakuba imwe abaabaire muri abahuuku b'ekibi, mbwenu muhindukire abarikutegyekwa enyegyesa ei mwahairwe, mukagyorobera omu mitima yaanyu; <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:32">Yoh 8:32</ref>. </char></note> kandi nk'oku mwacungwirwe okuruga omu butegyeki bw'ekibi, muhindukire abahuuku b'okuhikiirira. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Naagamba nk'omuntu ahabw'amaani makye ag'obuntu bwanyu; kwonka nk'oku mwabaire muhayo engingo zaanyu nk'abahuuku kukora ebihagaro n'eby'okushiisha ebirengyesereize, hati mube nikwo mwahayo engingo zaanyu nk'abahuuku kukora eby'okuhikiirira, mubone kwezibwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Obu mwabaire mukiri abahuuku b'ekibi, mukaba mutategyekwa kuhikiirira. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:6">Rom 8:6</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 8:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika, ni byana ki? </char></note>ni mugasho ki ogu mwatungire omu bunaku obwo omuri ebyo ebirikubakwatsa enshoni hati? Ahabw'okuba omuheru gwabyo n'okufa. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:9">1 Pet 1:9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka hati nk'oku mucungwirwe kuruga omu butegyeki bw'ekibi, mukahinduka abahuuku ba Ruhanga, ebyana ebi murikwana n'okwezibwa; kandi omuheru gwabyo n'amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ahakuba ebihembo by'ekibi n'okufa; kwonka ekiconco kya Ruhanga n'amagara agatahwaho omuri Kristo Yesu Mukama waitu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Omuntu okutegyekwa Ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />B'eishe-emwe, timurikumanya ku Ebiragiro bitegyeka omuntu, akiriho? (Ningambira abarikumanya Ebiragiro.) <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Nimumanya ngu omukazi oine iba, ekiragiro kimutegyeka kuguma na iba, akiriho; kandi iba ku afa, aba atakitegyekwa kiragiro kya iba. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Kwonka ku ashwerwa ondiijo mushaija, iba akiriho, ayetwa omushambani; kwonka iba ku afa, aba atakitegyekwa ekyo kiragiro; n'ahabw'ekyo ku ashwerwa omushaija ondiijo, tayetwa mushambani.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Nikyo kimwe, B'eishe-emwe, mukafa aha Biragiro ahabw'okufeera hamwe na Kristo omu mubiri gwe, ngu mubone kuba ab'ondiijo owaazoirwe omu bafu, ngu twanire Ruhanga ebyana. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Ku twabaire tukiri omu buzaarwa bw'omubiri, okwetenga ebibi kwaitu, okwaimukiibwe Ebiragiro, kukakorera omu ngingo zaitu ngu twanire okufa ebyana. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:1">Rom 8:1</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 8:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka hati tukomoroirwe, titwakitegyekwa Biragiro ahabw'okufa ahari ekyo ekyabaire kitukwatsire, ngu tubone kuheereza omu buhuuku busya obw'Omwoyo, butari bwa ira obw'ebihandiiko.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugasho gw'Ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:14">Kur 20:14</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu tugambe ki? Tuti: Ebiragiro nikyo kibi? Ngaaha! Tinkumanyire kibi, kuri ntarakimanyisiibwe Biragiro; ahakuba tinkumanyire kwetenga, kuri Ebiragiro bitaragizire biti: Otaryetenga. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Kwonka ekibi, ku kyaboine obwiho omu Biragiro, kyaimutsya omuriinye emiringo yoona ey'okwetenga; ahakuba ahatari Biragiro, ekibi kiba kifiire. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Naanye ira nkaba ndi ohuriire ahatari Biragiro; kwonka Ekiragiro, ku kyaizire, ekibi kyahimbuuka, nyowe naafa. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 1:15">Yak 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref>. </char></note> Ekiragiro, ekyakubaire eky'okumpa amagara, nkashanga kindugiiremu okufa; <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:13">Heb 3:13</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ekibi, ku kyaboine obwiho omu kiragiro, kyangobeza, kyanyita nikyema omuri ekyo kiragiro. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Mbwenu Ebiragiro nibyera, n'ekiragiro nikyera, kihikire, kandi ni kirungi.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Orugamba rw'omwoyo gw'omuntu n'obuhangwa bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Nimugira ngu ekirungi nikyo kyandeeteire okufa? Ngaaha! Ekyakundeeteire n'ekibi; kikaanyitsa ekirungi, ngu ekibi kimanywe ku kiri kibi, kandi ahabw'Ebiragiro kihindukye kibi buzima ekirengyesereize. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:6">Yoh 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nitumanya ngu Ebiragiro n'eby'Omwoyo; kwonka nyowe ndi ow'obuzaarwa bw'obuntu, nkagurwa kutegyekwa ekibi; <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />eki nkora, tinkimanya; ahabw'okuba eki nkunda kukora tikyo nkora; kureka eki nyanga nikyo nkora. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Mbwenu ku ndaabe nkora eki ntenda, biri niinyikiriza ngu Ebiragiro ni birungi. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />N'ahabw'ekyo tiinye nkikora, kureka ekibi ekituura omuriinye. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5">Kut 6:5</ref>. </char></note> Nimmanya ngu omuriinye omu buntu bwangye tihabamu karungi koona; ahakuba obutoosha nkunda kukora ekirungi, kwonka okukikora kundema. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Ekirungi eki nkunda kukora tikyo nkora; kureka ekibi eki nyanga nikyo nkora. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />N'ahabw'ekyo ku ndaabe nkora eki ntenda, tiinye nkikora, kureka ekibi ekintuuramu.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />N'ahabw'ekyo nshangire ebiragiro biri biti, nyowe ku mba niinyenda kukora ekirungi, ekibi kimba haihi. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Omu mutima gwangye nsiima ebiragiro bya Ruhanga; <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal 5:17</ref>. </char></note> kwonka omu ngingo zangye nshangamu ekindi kiragiro ekirwanisa ekiragiro eky'omu bwengye bwangye, kimpindura omuhuuku w'ebiragiro by'ekibi ebiri omu ngingo zangye. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Ai bambe, ka ndi omuntu enshoberwa! N'oha orinjuna omu mubiri ogu ogw'okufa? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:57">1 Kor 15:57</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga asiimwe, ahabwa Yesu Kristo Mukama waitu. Mbwenu omu bwengye bwangye nyorobera Ebiragiro bya Ruhanga, kwonka omu mubiri gwangye nyorobera ebiragiro by'ekibi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Amagara masya ag'abaine Omwoyo Orikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />N'ahabw'ekyo abari omuri Kristo Yesu tibakiine rubanja; <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:23">Rom 7:23</ref>. </char></note> hakuba ekiragiro ky'Omwoyo gw'amagara agari omuri Kristo Yesu kikankomoorora kutategyekwa kiragiro eky'ekibi n'okufa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:7">Fil 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:15">Heb 4:15</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaakora eki Ebiragiro bitarabaasize kukora ahabw'okuremesibwa amaani makye g'obuntu; yaatuma Omwana we omu kishushani ky'omubiri gw'ekibi, kandi ahabw'ekibi, yaacwera ekibi orubanja omu mubiri, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:16">Gal 5:16</ref>. </char></note> ngu ebi Ebiragiro birikutwihuza bibone kuhikiirira omuriitwe abatakuratira by'omubiri, kureka eby'Omwoyo. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Ahabw'okuba abakuratira eby'omubiri bata omutima aha by'omubiri; kwonka abakuratira Omwoyo bata omutima aha by'Omwoyo. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Mumanye ngu okuta omutima aha by'omubiri n'okufa; kwonka okuta omutima aha by'Omwoyo n'amagara n'obusingye; <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:4">Yak 4:4</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba okuta omutima aha by'omubiri n'obuzigu ahari Ruhanga; ahakuba tikworobera biragiro bya Ruhanga, kandi buzima tikubaasa kubyorobera; <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />n'ahabw'ekyo abarikutegyekwa omubiri tibabaasa kugwisa gye Ruhanga.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Kor 3:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka imwe timuri mu buryo bw'omubiri, kureka omu Mwoyo, Omwoyo wa Ruhanga ku araabe atuura omuriimwe buzima. Mumanye ngu omuntu weena otaine Mwoyo wa Kristo, ti muntu we na kakye. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Kristo ku araabe ari omuriimwe, biri omubiri gufiire ahabw'ekibi, kwonka omwoyo guhuriire ahabw'okuhikiirira. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Ku muraabe mutuurwamu Omwoyo w'Ogwo owaazoire Yesu omu bafu, Ogwo owaazoire Kristo Yesu omu bafu aryahindura n'emibiri yaanyu ey'okufa okuba ehuriire ahabw'Omwoyo we otuura omuriimwe.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />B'eishe-emwe, twine eibanja, ti ry'omubiri ngu tukuratire ebyagwo; <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22-24">Efe 4:22-24</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ku muraakuratire eby'omubiri, nimwija kufa; kwonka ku muraitse Omwoyo emicwe yaanyu ey'omubiri, muryaba abahuriire. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Manya, boona abeebemberwa Omwoyo wa Ruhanga, nibo baana ba Ruhanga; <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:7">2 Tim 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:5">Gal 4:5</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 4:6">6</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba timurahairwe mwoyo gw'obuhuuku kugaruka kutiina, kureka mukaheebwa Omwoyo owaabahindwire abaana ba Ruhanga, otugambisa tukagira tuti: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abba, amakuru gaakyo ngu: Taata. </char></note>Abba, Taata! <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Omwoyo ogwo niwe ahamya n'emyoyo yaitu ku turi abaana ba Ruhanga; <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:7">Gal 4:7</ref>. </char></note> kandi ku turaabe turi abaana, turi abahunguzi, abahunguzi ba Ruhanga, kandi ab'okuhungura hamwe na Kristo, ku turaabe nitushaasha hamwe nawe, ngu tubone kuheebwa ekitiinisa hamwe nawe.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:17">2 Kor 4:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ninteekateeka ngu obusaasi obu twine omu biro ebi, tibushemereire kugyeranisibwa n'ekitiinisa eki turishuuruurirwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Mumanye ngu ebyahangirwe byona bituura bitegyereize n'ekihika okushuuruurwa kw'abaana ba Ruhanga; <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />ahakuba ebihangirwe bikaragiirwa kutegyekwa ebitaine mugasho, ti habw'okweyendera, kureka kikakorwa Ogwo owaaragiire ku bitegyekwa bityo biine amatsiko; <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:2">1 Yoh 3:2</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba ebihangirwe ebyo nabyo biryacungurwa, birekye kuba eby'okujunda, kureka biheebwe obusingye bw'abaana ba Ruhanga obw'ekitiinisa. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Nitumanya ngu ebihangirwe byona bituura nibitsinda, nibisaasira hamwe n'okuhitsya hati; <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2">2 Kor 5:2</ref>. </char></note> kandi tibyo byonka, kureka naitwe abaine ebyana by'omujigaijo eby'Omwoyo, nitutsinda omu mitima yaitu, nitutegyereza kuhindurwa abaana ba Ruhanga, nikwo kucungurwa kw'emibiri yaitu; <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />ahakuba tukajunwa twine amatsiko ago. Manya, eki omuntu aineho amatsiko, ku aheza kukireeba, gaba gatakiri matsiko. Mbwenu n'oha ogira amatsiko aha ki arikureeba? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Kwonka ku tugira amatsiko aha ki tutakareebire, tukitegyereza n'okugumisiriza.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Oku nikwo Omwoyo atuhwera omu bweremwa bwaitu; ahakuba titumanya kushaba nk'oku kitushemereire, kwonka Omwoyo we wenka atutonganira n'okutsinda oku omuntu atakaabaasa kugamba. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:5">1 Kor 4:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ogwo, ocaaka emitima y'abantu, amanya ebi Omwoyo ateekateeka, ku atonganira abarikwera, nk'oku Ruhanga akunda.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:11">Efe 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nitumanya ngu, aha barikukunda Ruhanga, bakeetwa nk'enaama ye oku eri, byona ebibabaho bikwatanisiza hamwe kubareetera oburungi. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1:18</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba abu yaamanyire ira, nibo yaashoroire batakabaireho kushushanisibwa n'Omwana we, ngu abone kuba omujigaijo omu b'eishe-emwe baingi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Abu yaashoroire batakabaireho, nibo yaayetsire; n'abu yaayetsire, nibo yaihireho orubanja; kandi n'abu yaihireho orubanja, nibo yaahaire ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okutataanisibwa na rukundo ya Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:6">Zab 118:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu tugambe ki ahari ebyo? Ruhanga ku araabe ari aha rubaju rwaitu, oritubaasa n'oha? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Yoh 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Otaratwimire Mwana we ahabwe, kureka akamuhayo ahabwaitu twena, aryazibirwa ki kutuha byona hamwe nawe? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />N'oha orirega entoore za Ruhanga? Ni Ruhanga, haza kandi obaihaho orubanja? <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:1">1 Yoh 2:1</ref>. </char></note> N'oha oribacwera orubanja rw'okubasinga? Ni Kristo Yesu owaabafeereire, kandi okukira owaazookire omu bafu, ori aha rubaju rwa buryo rwa Ruhanga okututonganira? <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />N'oha oritutaanisa n'okukunda kwa Kristo? N'obusaasi, okwitwa kubi, okuhiigwa, enjara, okujwara busha, akabi, nari shi rurara? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">Zab 44:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 4:11">2 Kor 4:11</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">Ahabwawe nitwitwa eizooba ryona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">Nituteekateekwa nk'entaama z'okubaagwa.<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 16:33">Yoh 16:33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka omuri ebyo byona tusingwire nangwa n'okukiraho ahabw'Ogwo owaatukunzire. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ahakuba nimmanyira kimwe ngu okufa, n'obu gaakuba amagara, nari baamaraika, nari abarikutegyeka, nari ebiriho, nari ebiribaho, nari ab'obushoboorozi, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />nari oburaingwa obwa bwemi nari oburaingwa obw'okuzimu, n'obu kyakuba ekindi kintu kyona ekihangirwe, tihaine kiribaasa kututaanisa n'okukunda kwa Ruhanga okuri omuri Kristo Yesu Mukama waitu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo okusaasibwa okutaikiriza kw'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ningamba amazima omuri Kristo, tindikubeiha; nimpamya n'omutima gwangye omu Mwoyo Orikwera, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />ku nyine enaku nyingi n'obusaasi obutarikutuuza omu mutima gwangye. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Kur 32:32</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba nkaayenzire ngu nyowe ahabwangye nkyeenwe, kandi ncuubwe ahari Kristo ahabwa beene waitu ab'oruganda rwangye omu mubiri, nibo Baisraeli, <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:6">Bir 7:6</ref>. </char></note> abaahairwe omugabo gw'okuba abaana ba Ruhanga, n'ekitiinisa kye, n'endagaano ze, n'Ebiragiro n'emigyenzo y'okuramya Ruhanga, n'ebyaraganisiibwe; <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />nibo baakomookire ahari baatatenkuriitwe; kandi na Kristo nibo yaakomookiremu omu mubiri, otegyeka byona, kandi niwe Ruhanga ohimbisibwa ebiro byona. Amiina.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:28">Rom 2:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku ndikugamba ntyo, tindikugira nti: Ekigambo kya Ruhanga tikirahikire; ahabw'okuba ti kugira ngu abaakomookire omuri Israeli boona n'Abaisraeli buzima; <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Kut 21:12</ref>. </char></note> kandi okuba oruzaaro rwa Abrahamu tikyo kihindura boona abaana be buzima; kwonka nikigira kiti: Baijukuru baawe baryayetererwa Isaaka. <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:23">Gal 4:23</ref>. </char></note> Nikwo kugira ngu, abazairwe omu mubiri tibo baana ba Ruhanga, kureka abazairwe omu ndagaano nibo babarwa kuba abaijukuru. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Kut 18:10</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ku ekigambo ekyaraganisiibwe kyagizire kiti: Omu bunaku nk'obu ndyagaruka, kandi Saara aryazaara omwana w'omwojo. <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:21-23">Kut 25:21-23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi t'ekyo kyonka, kureka na Rebeka, ku yaabaire abakire enda y'empasha z'omushaija tatenkuriitwe Isaaka, <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11-13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mal 1:2</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 1:3">3</ref>. </char></note> yaagambirwa ngu: Kakuru aryaheereza Kato, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Yakobo nkamukunda, Esau naamwanga; yaabigambirwa, abaana abo batakazairwe, kandi batakakozire kirungi nari ekibi, ngu eki Ruhanga yaatooraine omu naama ye kigumeho, kiteegamiire mirimo, kureka Ogwo owaatwetsire.<verse eid="ROM 9:11-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Mbwenu tugambe ki? Tuti, omu mitwarize ya Ruhanga habamu okutainganisa? Rubuuza! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Kur 33:19</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba akagambira Musa ati: Ndyasaasira ou ndisaasira, kandi ndyagirira embabazi ou ndizigirira. <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo tikirikwegamira kweyendera kw'omuntu, nari obweziriki bwe, kureka okusaasira kwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Kur 9:16</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu, omu Byahandiikirwe Ruhanga akagira Faraho ati: Eki naakwemekyeire n'okukworekyeraho amaani gangye, ngu eiziina ryangye rigambwe omu nsi zoona. <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:12">Kur 9:12</ref>. </char></note> Nikwo asaasira ou ayenda kusasira, kandi agangaaza omutima gw'ogwo ou ayenda ngu gugangaare.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Mbwenu noija kumbuuza oti: Ahanki naakibarira abantu ebishobyo? Kandi n'oha owaakubaasa kuzibira ebi arikwenda? <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:9">Isa 45:9</ref>. </char></note> Beitu shi, iwe omuntu, niiwe oha orikuhakanisa Ruhanga? Ekibumbirwe nikibaasa kubuuza owaakibumbire kiti, Ahabw'enki okambumba oti? <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:6">Yer 18:6</ref>. </char></note> Omubumbi taine obushoboorozi aha ibumba omu mugoma gumwe kubumbamu orwabya rumwe rw'okukoresa eby'ekitiinisa, n'orundi rw'okukoresa ebirikwitsa enshoni? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Mbwenu Ruhanga, ku araabe yaayenzire kworeka ekiniga kye, n'okumanyisa obushoboorozi bwe, nikiita ki We okugumisiririza n'embabazi ze nyingi enyabya ez'ekiniga ezaateekateekyeirwe okuhwerekyerera; <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-12">Efe 1:3-12</ref>. </char></note> ngu abone kworeka obutungi bw'ekitiinisa kye aha nyabya ez'okusaasirwa ezi yaateekateekyeire ekitiinisa okuruga ira, <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />niitwe abu yaayetsire, ti mu Bayudaaya bonka, kureka n'omu Banyamahanga? <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku yaagambire naaraba omuri nabi Hosea ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Abantu abatari b'eihanga ryangye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Ndyabeeta eihanga ryangye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Kandi owaabaire ari enyangwakazi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Ndyamweta enkundwakazi.<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi omu mwanya ogwo ahu baagambiriirwe ngu timuri ihanga ryangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:26">Niho baryeterwa abaana ba Ruhanga ohuriire.<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:22">Isa 10:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Isaaya nawe akagamba aha Baisraeli ati: Omubaro gw'Abaisraeli n'obu guriba nk'omusheenyi gw'aha nyanja, abarihonokaho bonka nibo barijunwa; <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />ahakuba Mukama aryahikiiriza orubanja oru yaacwereire ensi, aruheze atarusiibizeho. <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa 1:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nk'oku Isaaya yaagizire ira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">Kuri Mukama ow'amahe ataratutsigiireho baijukuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">Tukaabaire nka Sodoma, tushushana na Gomora.<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Mbwenu tugambe ki? Tuti: Abanyamahanga, abatarakuratiire kuhikiirira, bakakuhikaho, nikwo kuhikiirira okuruga omu kwikiriza; <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:2">Rom 10:2</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 10:3">3</ref>. </char></note> kwonka Abaisraeli, abaakuratiire Ebiragiro by'okuhikiirira, tibarahikize biragiro byakwo. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Bakazibirwa ki? Ahabw'okuba tibareezirikire kukuhikaho ahabw'okwikiriza, kureka ahabw'emirimo. Baateera entsibo aha ibaare ry'okuteerwaho entsibo, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6">1 Pet 2:6</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Reeba, ninta omuri Saayuuni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Eibaare eririkuteeza entsibo n'orukiri orurikugwisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Kandi orikumwikiriza tarikwatwa nshoni.<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okuhaba omuhanda gw'okuhikiirira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />B'eishe-emwe, ekyakunanura omutima gwangye, kandi eki nshabira Abaisraeli ahari Ruhanga nikyo eki, ngu bajunwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ahakuba nimpamya nti: Baine obweziriki ahari Ruhanga, kwonka tiburimu kushoborokyerwa; <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />ahabw'okutamanya kuhikiirira okurikuruga ahari Ruhanga, bakeesherurira oku baakuhamya okuhikiirira kwabo ahabwabo, tibaroorobeire kuhikiirira okurikuruga ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:17">Mat 5:17</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omuri Kristo nimwo Ebiragiro bihikiiririzibwa, ngu abone kuhaisa okuhikiirira omuntu weena orikwikiriza.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nimumanya ngu Musa akahandiika eby'okuhikiirira okuheebwa ahabw'okuhitsya Ebiragiro ati: Orikubihitsya aryagira amagara ahabwabyo. <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Bir 30:12-14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka okuhikiirira okwegamiire okwikiriza nikugira kuti: Otagamba omu mutima gwawe oti: N'oha oritemba omu iguru? (Amakuru ngu, okushuumya Kristo ahansi,) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />nari shi oti: N'oha orishuuma okuzimu? (Amakuru ngu, okwiha Kristo omu bafu.) <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Beitu kugira kuta? Kugira kuti, Ekigambo kikuri haihi, omu kanwa kaawe n'omu mutima gwawe, nikyo kigambo ky'okwikiriza eki tubuurira; <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />tuti: Ku oryatura n'akanwa kaawe oti, Yesu niwe Mukama, waikiriza n'omutima gwawe ku Ruhanga yaamuzoire omu bafu, oryajunwa; <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />ahakuba omutima nigwo omuntu aikiririsa akaheebwa okuhikiirira, kandi akanwa niko ayatuza akaheebwa okujunwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:31">Rom 9:31</ref>. </char></note> Ebyahandiikirwe nibigira biti: Omuntu weena orikumwikiriza tarikwatwa nshoni. <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Tihariho mutaano gw'Omuyudaaya n'Omugriika; ahakuba Mukama omwe niwe Mukama wa boona, kandi n'omutungi ahari boona abamutakira; <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Yoel 2:32</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba omuntu weena oritakira eiziina rya Mukama aryajunwa.<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubuurira engiri omu mahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Mbwenu shi, abantu baryatakira bata, ou batakaikiriize? Kandi bayaikiriza bata ou batakahuriraga? Kandi baryahurira bata ahatari mubuurizi? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa 52:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baryabuurira bata batatumirwe? Nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Ebigyere by'ababuurizi ka ni birungi munonga, abo ababuurira engiri y'ebigambo ebirungi! <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abaayorobiere engiri ti boona; ahakuba Isaaya akagira ati: Mukama n'oha oikiriize ebi twarangire? <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Manya, okwikiriza kuruga omu bi tuhurira, kandi ebi tuhurira biruga omu kigambo kya Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:4">Zab 19:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Beitu nimbuuza nti: Tibarahuriire? Eego, buzima bakahurira; ahakuba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">Eiraka ryabyo rikabuga omu nsi zoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">N'ebigambo byabyo byahika aha muheru gw'ensi.<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:21">Bir 32:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nimbuuza nti: Abaisraeli tibarabimanyire? Musa niwe yaabandize kugira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Ndyabaitsa eihari aha ihanga eritari ihanga buzima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Ndyabakwatsa ekiniga n'eihanga eritaine bwengye.<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:1">Isa 65:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 65:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Isaaya akagamba n'obumanzi ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">Nkabonwa abataransherwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">Naayeyoreka abatarambuuririize.<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Kwonka aha Baisraeli yaagira ati: Eizooba ryona nsiiba ntegire emikono eihanga eritahurira kandi erigomi.<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Okugarurwa kw'Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 12:22">1 Sam 12:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nimbuuza nti: Ruhanga akacwera kimwe abantu be? Ngaaha! Ahakuba naanye ndi Omwisraeli ow'omu nda ya Abrahamu omu ruganda rwa Benyamiini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Bag 19:10</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga taracwire bantu be abu yaamanyire batakabaireho. Timurikumanya ebi Ebyahandiikirwe bigamba ahari Eliya, oku yaaregire Abaisraeli ahari Ruhanga? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Ati: Mukama baitsire baanabi baawe, basheenyire amatambiro gaawe; niinye ntsigaireho nyenka, kandi naanye nibenda kuunyita. <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Bag 19:18</ref>. </char></note> Beitu Ruhanga akamugarukamu ata? Ati: Nyetsigariize abantu enkumi mushanju abatakatsimbiraga Baali maju. <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Na mbwenu omu bunaku obu nikwo biri; hariho abantu bakye abatsigaireho abaatoorainwe embabazi. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Kwonka, ku biraabe biri ahabw'embabazi, tibikiri habw'emirimo; ahakuba ku kyakubaire kitari kityo, embabazi tizaakubaire mbabazi.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 9:31">Rom 9:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu tugambe ki? Tuti: Abaisraeli tibaraboine ki baasherwire; kureka abatoorainwe nibo baakiboine; kwonka abandi bakagangaazibwa, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />nk'oku kyahandiirwe ngu: Ruhanga akabaha omutima gw'okuhungira, n'amaisho ngu batareeba, n'amatu ngu batahurira n'okuhitsya eri izooba. <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Zab 69:22</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 69:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Daudi akagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">Emeeza yaabo ebahinduukire omutego n'orugogo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">N'enkongi, n'eky'okubaihura.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Amaisho gaabo gashwekwe omwirima, ngu batahweza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:10">Emigongo yaabo ogiinikye ebiro byona.<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:19">Rom 10:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo ndikubuuriza nti: Bakateera entsibo, ngu bagwe? Ngaaha! Kureka ahabw'okucumura kwabo, okujunwa kwizire aha Banyamahanga kubaitsa eihari. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Mbwenu okucumura kwabo ku kuraabe kwatungiise ab'ensi zoona, kandi n'okuremwa kwabo kukatungisa Abanyamahanga, kaashwa okugarurwa kwabo!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Kwonka ningambira imwe Abanyamahanga. Nk'oku ndi entumwa aha Banyamahanga, nimpimbisa obutumwa bwangye, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />ngu nkaakwatsa beene waitu Abayudaaya eihari, abamwe omuribo bajunwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Okucuubwa kwabo ku kuraabe nikureetera ab'ensi zoona kugarukana na Ruhanga, okugarurwa kwabo kuryareeta ki? Tikurireeta okuzooka omu bafu? <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Esaano y'omuganuro ku eba eri erikwera, n'ekiihuro kyona nikwo kiba; kandi ekitsitsa ku kiba kiri ekirikwera, n'amataagi nikwo gaba. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:11-19">Efe 2:11-19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka amataagi agamwe ku garaabe gaahangwirweho, kandi iwe owaabaire ori omuzeituuni ogwo, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />oteehimbisiza aha mataagi. Ku oraabe nooyehimbisa, oijukye ngu tiiwe ekitsitsa kimezireho, kureka niiwe omezire aha kitsitsa. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Obundi okaagira oti: Amataagi gakahagurwa ngu nyowe mbyarwemu. <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:16">Rom 12:16</ref>. </char></note> N'eky'amazima; gakahagurwa ahabw'okutaikiriza kwago; haza naiwe okwikiriza kwawe nikwo kukwemereize. Oteemanya, kureka otiine; <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />ahakuba Ruhanga ku araabe atarasaasiire mataagi agahangiirweho, naiwe tarikusaasira. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:14">Heb 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Yetegyereze embabazi za Ruhanga, kandi n'okutasaasira kwe; ahari abo abaagwire, n'okutasaasira kwe; kwonka ahariiwe n'embabazi ze, ku oraabe n'ozigumamu; ku oriba otazigumiremu, naiwe oryahagurwaho. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Kandi nabo, ku bariba batagumiire mu butaikiriza bwabo, baryabyarwamu, ahakuba Ruhanga aine obushoboorozi kugaruka kubabyaramu. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Omanye ngu ku oraabe waahagwirwe aha muzeituuni ogw'omu ishwa omu buhangwa, okabyarwa omu muzeituuni omurungi, ogu waabaire otaine buzaare nagwo, amataagi gari agaabaire gari ag'obuhangwa tigarikira munonga kugaruka kubyarwa aha muzeituuni gwago?<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luk 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:16">Yoh 10:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> B'eishe-emwe, niinyenda ngu mushoborokyerwe enaama egi, murekye kweyeta abanyabwengye. Mumanye ku ekicweka ky'Abaisraeli kyagizire obugangaazi, okuhitsya obu Abanyamahanga baritaaha omu kanisa, bakahika omubaro oguhikire; <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20">Isa 59:20</ref>. </char></note> obwo Abaisraeli boona baryajunwa, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">Omujuni aryaruga omuri Saayuuni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">Aihe omuri Yakobo okutatiina Ruhanga;<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33">Yer 31:33</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:34">34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi egyo niyo ndagaanao yangye nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:27">Ku ndibaihaho ebibi byabo.<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Omu by'engiri bo n'abazigu ba Ruhanga ahabwanyu; kwonka omu by'okutooranwa Ruhanga n'abarikukundwa ahabwa baishenkurubo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Mumanye ngu ebi Ruhanga agaba n'okweta kwe tabyefuuza. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Nk'oku ira mwabaire mugomeire Ruhanga, kwonka hati musaasiirwe ahabw'obugomi bwabo, <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />nikwo nabo hati bagomire, ngu embabazi ezi mwagiriirwe zibareetere okusaasirwa; <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:22">Gal 3:22</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Ruhanga akabarira hamwe abantu boona omu bugomi, ngu abone kusaasira boona.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Yeimwe! Obutungi bwa Ruhanga, obwengye bwe n'okumanya kwe ka bitaine bugarukiro! Emicwere ye n'emitwarize ye tibirikubaasa kumanywa.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:34: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa 40:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha oramanyire obwengye bwa Mukama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">Nari n'oha orabaire omuhanuuzi we?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Nari n'oha orabandize kumuha ekintu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:35">Ngu amuzimuurire?<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Ahakuba byona niwe bikomookaho, kandi bibaho ahabwe, kandi niwe mukama waabyo; aheebwe ekitiinisa ebiro byona. Amiina.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Emicwe eshemereire amagara ag'Obukristaayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:5">1 Pet 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, nimbeeshengyereza ahabw'embabazi za Ruhanga, ku muhayo embiri yaanyu kuba ebitambo ebihuriire, ebirikwera, kandi ebirikusiima Ruhanga, nikwo kuheereza kwanyu oku mushemereire kumuha. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:17">Efe 5:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mutashushanisibwa n'ab'obusingye obu, kureka muhindurwe basya ahabw'okugarurwa obusya omu biteekateeko byanyu, mubone kumanya gye ebi Ruhanga akunda, oku biri birungi, ebirikusiimwa, kandi ebihikire buzima.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:7">Efe 4:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'embabazi ezi naahairwe, ningambira buri muntu weena omuriimwe, ngu arekye kweteekateekaho okukira oku ari, kureka ateekateekye okutarenzya oku ari, nk'oku Ruhanga yaagyereire omuntu weena okwikiriza. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:12">1 Kor 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 12:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu, nk'oku twine engingo nyingi omu mubiri, kandi nk'oku zoona zikora emirimo etari emwe, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Efe 4:25</ref>. </char></note> naitwe nikwo turi; turi baingi, kwonka omuri Kristo turi omubiri gumwe, kandi omuntu weena n'orugingo rwa mugyenzi we. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4">1 Kor 12:4</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku twine ebiconco ebitari bimwe, nk'embabazi ezi twahairwe oku ziine omutaano, tubikorese; ku kuraabe kuri okubuurira, tubuurire nk'oku tugyereirwe okwikiriza; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:10">1 Pet 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 4:11">11</ref>. </char></note> nari okuheereza, twezirikye kuheereza; nari orikwegyesa, ayezirikye kwegyesa; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 9:7">2 Kor 9:7</ref>. </char></note> orikuhabura, ayezirikye kuhabura; orikugaba, agabe n'obufura; orikutegyeka, ategyekye n'obweziriki; n'orikugira embabazi, azigire ashemereirwe.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Okukunda kwanyu kutabamu oburyarya. Mwangire kimwe ekibi, muhamire aha kirungi; <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:3">Fil 2:3</ref>. </char></note> omu kukunda ab'eishe-emwe, mukundane buzima; omu kuhaana ekitiinisa, buri muntu ateekateekye ahari mugyenzi we okumweshumba; <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 3:15">Kush 3:15</ref>. </char></note> omu bweziriki mutaba abeeremwa; emyoyo yaanyu etagate, muheereze Mukama. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Mushemererwe mwine amatsiko; mugumisirize omu busaasi; mugumizemu kushaba muhamire. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Heb 13:2</ref>. </char></note> Muhe aha byanyu okuhwera abarikwera omu bukyene bwabo; mwezirikye kukunira abagyenyi.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat 5:44</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:59">Byak 7:59</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 4:12">1 Kor 4:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mushabire omugisha abarikubahiiga; mubashabire omugisha, mutabakyeena. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Mushemererwe hamwe n'abarikushemererwa; murire hamwe n'abarikurira. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:21">Isa 5:21</ref>. </char></note> Mugire omutima gumwe omu bi murikuteekateekanaho; mutata omutima aha by'ekitiinisa, kureka mugyende hamwe n'abataine kitiinisa. Muteemanya ku muri abanyabwengye. <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:15">1 Tes 5:15</ref>. </char></note> Mutaihura omuntu weena ekibi ahabw'ekibi; mwerinde, ebi murikukora bireebekye bihikire omu maisho g'abantu boona. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:14">Heb 12:14</ref>. </char></note> Ku kiraabe nikibaasika aha rubaju rwanyu, mutuurane n'abantu boona n'obusingye. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Bir 32:35</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 13:4">Rom 13:4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:30">Heb 10:30</ref>. </char></note> Imwe abarikukundwa, muteehoorera enzigu, mukurekyere ekiniga kya Ruhanga, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Okuhoora enzigu n'okwangye; niinye ndizimuura, nikwo Mukama arikugira. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21">Enf 25:21</ref>, <ref loc="PRO 25:22">22</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omuzigu waawe ku araagire enjara, omugaburire; ku araakwatwe eiriho, omuhe eky'okunywa; ahabw'okuba omu kukora otyo nooba omurunzire amakara g'omuriro aha mutwe. <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Otasingurwa ekibi, kureka ekibi okisinguze ekirungi.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okworobera abategyeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 3:1">Tit 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:15">Enf 8:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena ayorobere abakama abarikutegyeka; ahakuba tihariho butegyeki obutaruga ahari Ruhanga; kandi abategyeki abariho bateebwaho Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />N'ahabw'ekyo orikugomera obutegyeki, naaba agomeire eki Ruhanga yaataireho; kandi abarikugoma beereetera orubanja. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:13">1 Pet 2:13</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 2:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Nimumanya ngu abategyeki tibatiinwa barikukora gye, kureka abarikukora kubi. Mbwenu nooyenda kutatiina mutegyeki? Kora ebirungi, haza aryakusiima; <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />ahabw'okuba we n'omuheereza wa Ruhanga ow'okukuhaisa ebirungi. Kwonka ku oraabe nookora kubi, otiine; ahakuba takwatira busha rurara; kureka n'omuheereza wa Ruhanga, ohoora enzigu aha muntu okora kubi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />N'ahabw'ekyo mushemereire kuboorobera, ti habw'okutiina kiniga ekyo kwonka, kureka n'ahabw'eiraka ry'omwoyo. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Kandi nikyo muheera omushoro, ahakuba abakama abo n'abaheereza ba Ruhanga abeezirika kukora omurimo ogwo obutoosha. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat 22:21</ref>. </char></note> Mwihure boona ebi barikubaihuza; abarikushoza mubahe omushoro; abarikuhooza mubahoorere; ab'okutiinwa mubatiine; ab'ekitiinisa mubahe ekitiinisa.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okukundana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 5:14">Gal 5:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mutarigira eibanja ryona aha muntu, kureka ery'okukundana; ahakuba okunda mutaahi we, aba ahikize Ebiragiro. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ahabw'okuba ebi ngu, Otarishambana, otariita, Otariiba, Otaryetenga eby'abandi, n'ebindi biragiro byona, biteeranira omu kigambo eki ngu: Kunda mutaahi waawe nk'oku oyekunda. <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:4">1 Kor 13:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:40">Mat 22:40</ref>. </char></note> Oine okukunda tagirira mutaahi we kubi; n'ahabw'ekyo okukunda nikwo kuhitsya Ebiragiro.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okweteguurira Okugaruka kwa Mukama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Kandi mugume mukore mutyo, ahakuba nimumanya ngu obunaku buhikire imwe kusisiimuka omu turo; ahabw'okuba okujunwa kutwiriire haihi okukira obu twatandika kwikiriza. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:11">Efe 5:11</ref>. </char></note> Ekiro kyahweire; buri haihi kusheesha; n'ahabw'ekyo ka tujuure emicwe y'omwirima, tujware eby'okurwanisa eby'omushana; <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:34">Luk 21:34</ref>. </char></note> tugyende tushemeire, nk'abarikugyenda nyomushana, tutarikujagarara, tutarikusinda, tutarikushambana, tutarikukora birikwitsa enshoni, tutarikutongana, tutarikugirirana ihari. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:27">Gal 3:27</ref>. </char></note> Kureka mujware Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, kandi mutaha omubiri orwekwatso kukora ebi gurikwetenga.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Okutacwererana manja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:1">Rom 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 8:9">1 Kor 8:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otaine maani omu kwikiriza kwe, mumwakiire, kwonka mutamucwera orubanja omu bi arikubanganisa. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Omuntu omwe aine okwikiriza okurikumubaasisa kurya byona; kwonka otaine maani, arya emboga zonka. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Orikurya byona arekye kugaya otarikubirya; kandi otarikubirya arekye kucwera orikubirya orubanja; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga akamwakiira. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:11">Yak 4:11</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 4:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Niiwe oha orikucwera omuhuuku w'ondiijo orubanja? Mukama we niwe orikumanya ku ayemereire, nari ku agwire. Kandi buzima, aryayemerezibwa, ahabw'okuba Mukama waitu aine amaani kumwemereza.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 4:10">Gal 4:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu omwe ateekateeka ekiro kimwe kuba kikuru okukira ebindi; ondiijo ateekateeka ebiro byona kwingana. Omuntu weena amanyire kimwe atarikubanganisa omu mutima gwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Orinda ekiro akirinda ahabwa Mukama; n'orya byona, nawe abirya ahabwa Mukama, ahabw'okuba asiima Ruhanga; kandi obyanga abyanga ahabwa Mukama, kandi nawe asiima Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Ahakuba omuriitwe tihariho obaho ahabwe wenka, kandi tihariho ofa ahabwe wenka. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:20">Gal 2:20</ref>. </char></note> Ku tubaho, tubaho ahabwa Mukama; kandi ku tufa, tufa ahabwa Mukama; n'ahabw'ekyo, yaaba twabaho, yaaba twafa, turi aba Mukama. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Ekyo nikyo Kristo yaafeereire kandi akazooka, ngu abone kuba Mukama w'abafiire n'abahuriire.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:31">Byak 17:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu shi iwe, ahabw'enki noocwera mwene Sho orubanja? Nari shi noogayira ki mwene Sho? Ahakuba twena turyayemerera omu maisho g'ekitebe ky'eiramuriro ekya Ruhanga; <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:10">Fil 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 2:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa 45:23</ref>. </char></note> nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">Mukama naayerahira ati: Nk'oku ndi ohuriire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">Abantu boona baryantsimbira amaju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">N'orurimi rwona ruryahimbisa Ruhanga.<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Nikwo buri omwe omuriitwe aryegambira, naayetonganira ahari Ruhanga.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />N'ahabw'ekyo okuruga hati turekye kucwererana emanja; kureka buri muntu omuriitwe ahamize kimwe okutateeza mwene Ishe ntsibo, nari okukora ekirikumugwisa. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:11">Mat 15:11</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:15">Tit 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Nimmanya, kandi niinyikiririza kimwe omuri Mukama waitu Yesu nti: Tihariho kintu kyona ekyahangirwe nikizira ahabwakyo; kwonka omuntu ku ateekateeka ngu nikizira, ahariwe kizira. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 8:11-13">1 Kor 8:11-13</ref>. </char></note> Mwene Sho ku araabe naakorwa kubi ebi orikurya, nooba otakigyendera mu kukunda. Otahwerekyereza n'eby'okurya byawe ogwo ou Kristo yaafeereire. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo otajumisa ekirungi kyawe. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Manya, obukama bwa Ruhanga ti by'okurya, nari eby'okunywa, kureka okuhikiirira n'obusingye n'okushemererwa omu Mwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Ahakuba oheereza atyo Kristo, niwe ashemeza Ruhanga, kandi asiimwe n'abantu. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:18">Rom 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:2">15:2</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo tukuratire ebirikureeta obusingye n'okwombekana. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Mutashiisha omurimo gwa Ruhanga ahabw'eby'okurya. Omu mazima byona bishemeire; kwonka ni kibi omuntu kugwisa abandi ahabw'ebi arikurya. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ni kirungi okutarya nyama, nari okunywa viinyo, nari okukora ekintu kyona ekirikuteeza mwene Sho entsibo, nari okumugwisa nari okumumaramu amaani. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Okwikiriza oku oine, ogume nakwo omu mutima gwawe omu maisho ga Ruhanga. Otarikwecwera rubanja omu bi arikwikiriza ahiiriirwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Kwonka ogwo orikubanganisa, ku arya, asingwa orubanja, ahabw'okuba tiyaarya aikiriize; kandi kyona ekitaruga mu kwikiriza, kiba kibi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Okuteeshemeza twenka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Itwe abaine amaani tushemereire kwekorera obweremwa bw'abatagaine, turekye kweshemeza twenka. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:33">1 Kor 10:33</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena omuriitwe ashemeze mutaahi we, amukwatse omu birungi eby'okumukuza; <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Zab 69:9</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba na Kristo tareeshemeize wenka; kwonka nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu: Ebijumo ebi baakujumire niinye byagwereire. <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:11">1 Kor 10:11</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu Ebyahandiikirwe ira byona bikahandiikwa kutwegyesa, ngu tubone kugira amatsiko ahabw'okugumisiriza, n'ahabw'okuhuumuzibwa Ebyahandiikirwe ebyo. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Mbwenu, Ruhanga mukama w'okugumisiriza n'okuhuumuza abahe okukwatanisa omu biteekateeko byanyu, nk'oku Kristo Yesu akunda, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />mubone kuhimbisa Ruhanga Ishe wa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo n'omutima gumwe n'akanwa kamwe.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo mwakiirane, nk'oku Kristo yaabaakiire, Ruhanga abone kuhimbisibwa. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Eki ndikugamba n'eki nti: Kristo akahinduka omuheereza w'abashazirwe ow'okubooreka amazima ga Ruhanga, ngu abone kuhamya ebi baishenkurubo baaraganisiibwe, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Sam 22:50</ref>. </char></note> kandi ngu Abanyamahanga bahimbise Ruhanga ahabw'okusaasira kwe, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">Nikyo ndikuhimbisiza omu Banyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">Kandi nkeeshongorera eiziina ryawe.<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Kandi ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">Imwe Abanyamahanga, mushemererwe hamwe n'eihanga rye.<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Kandi ahandi ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">Muhimbise Mukama, imwe mwena Abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">Kandi n'amahanga goona gamuhimbise.<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa 11:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Isaaya nawe akagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Haryabaho ekitsitsa kya Yese,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Niwe ariimuka kutegyeka Abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Kandi niwe Abanyamahanga barigiramu amatsiko.<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Ruhanga mukama w'amatsiko abaijuze okushemererwa kwona n'obusingye omu kwikiriza, amatsiko gaanyu gakanyisibwe amaani g'Omwoyo Orikwera.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okugira amatsiko g'okutaayaayira Rooma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Beene Tata, nimmanya gye ebyanyu ntarikubanganisa, ku mwijwire emicwe mirungi n'okwetegyereza kwona, kandi ku murikubaasa kuhuguurana. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Kwonka ebimwe omu baruha egi naabibahandiikira n'obumanzi, nimbaijutsya, oku Ruhanga yaangiriire embabazi, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:13">Rom 11:13</ref>. </char></note> akantaho kuba omuheereza wa Yesu Kristo aha Banyamahanga ow'okukora omurimo gw'engiri ya Ruhanga nk'omunyamurwa, ngu Abanyamahanga babe empongano erikusiimwa, eyeziibwe Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />N'ahabw'ekyo, omuri Kristo Yesu nyine eby'okwehimbisizaho omu murimo ogu nkoreire Ruhanga. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Tinkaayehanga kugamba aha bindi kureka aha bi naakoresiibwe Kristo kworobya Abanyamahanga, omu kugamba n'omu kukora, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />ahabw'amaani g'obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza, nimbukoresibwa Omwoyo Orikwera; okuruga Yerusaalemu, okwehinguririza okuhika Iluriko, nkabuurira hoona engiri ya Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 10:15">2 Kor 10:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 10:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nkeezirika kubuurira engiri ahi eiziina rya Kristo ritakamanywaga, ngu ndekye kwombeka aha musingi ogwatairweho abandi; <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />kibone kuba nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">Abatakagambirwaga ebye baryareeba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">Kandi abatakahuriraga baryashoborokyerwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Nikyo naagiriire ebirikunzibira kaingi kwija owaanyu; <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />kwonka hati, nk'oku ntakiine hatsigaire omu mahanga aga, kandi mmazire emyaka mingi niinyetenga kwija owaanyu, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />ku ndiba ninza Spania, nyine amatsiko kubarabaho nkabareeba; kandi ku ndimara naimwe ebiro bikye, naabahwa orushusho, mubone kunshendekyereza omu rugyendo rwangye. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Kwonka hati ninza Yerusaalemu nintwara eby'okuhwera abarikwera; <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:1">2 Kor 8:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 9:12">9:12</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba aba Makedonia n'aba Akaya bakasiima kuteerana eby'okuhwera abooro ab'omu barikwera abari Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1 Kor 9:11</ref>. </char></note> Bakasiima kukikora, kandi buzima nibahurira baine eibanja aharibo, ahabw'okuba Abanyamahanga ku baraabe baakwataniise nabo omu by'Omwoyo, nibaihuzibwa kubahwera omu by'omubiri. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />N'ahabw'ekyo, ku ndiheza kubahitsya ebiconco ebyo, ndyabarabaho ninza Spania. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:11">Rom 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nimmanya ngu, ku ndiija owaanyu, ndyaija nyijwire omugisha gwa Kristo.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 1:11">2 Kor 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nimbeeshengyereza, B'eishe-emwe, ahabwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo n'ahabw'okukunda kw'Omwoyo, ku mwezirikira hamwe naanye kunshabira ahari Ruhanga, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />mbone kukira ab'omu Bayudaaya abatarikwikiriza, kandi n'eby'obuhwezi ebi ndikutwara Yerusaalemu bisiimwe abarikwera; <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />ntyo naanye Ruhanga ku araasiime, mbone kwija owaanyu nshemereirwe, turuhuukire hamwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Ruhanga mukama w'obusingye agume naimwe mwena. Amiina.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Okuramutsya kwa Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Nimbasiimira munyaanyaitwe Foibe omudiikonikazi w'ekanisa ya Kenkerea; <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />mumwakiire omuri Mukama waitu, nk'oku kishemereire abarikwera, kandi mumuhwere omuri byona ebi aryatenga ahariimwe; ahabw'okuba abaire naahwera baingi, naanye ntababuziremu. <verse eid="ROM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Mundamukize Priska na Akula, abakozi bagyenzi bangye omuri Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />abaabaire beehaireyo kucuubwaho ebitsya ahabw'amagara gangye. Tiinye nyenka orikubasiima, kureka n'amakanisa goona ag'Abanyamahanga; <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />kandi muramutsye ekanisa ey'omu ka yaabo. Muramutsye na munywani wangye Epaineeto, owaabandize kuhindukira Kristo omuri Asia. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Muramutsye Mariamu owaabakoreire munonga. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Muramutsye Anderoniiko na Yuniasi, ab'omuryango gwangye, abu naabohirwe nabo, abashaija rugambwa omu ntumwa, kandi abambandiize omuri Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Muramutsye Ampuliato, munywani wangye omuri Mukama. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Muramutsye Urubano, omukozi mugyenzi waitu omuri Kristo hamwe na Staako munywani wangye. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Muramutsye Apele, orikusiimwa omuri Kristo. Muramutsye n'ab'omuka ya Aristobulo. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Muramutsye Herodioni ow'omuryango gwangye. Muramutsye abo abari omuri Mukama ab'omu ka ya Nakiso. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Muramutsye Trufaina na Trufoosa abarikukorera omuri Mukama. Muramutsye Peresi orikukundwa, owaayezirikire kukorera omuri Mukama. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Muramutsye Rufo owaatoorainwe omuri Mukama, kandi na nyina naanye ou nyeta maawe. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Muramutsye Asunkuriito, Fulegoni, Herume, Patiroba, Heruma n'ab'eishe-emwe abatwire nabo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Muramutsye Filologo, Yulia, Nereu na munyaanya, na Olumpa n'abarikwera boona abatwire nabo. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Muramukanise okunywegyerana okurikwera. Amakanisa ga Kristo goona gaabaramutsya.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Kandi nimbeeshengyereza, B'eishe-emwe, mwetegyereze abo abarikureeta eby'okubataanisa n'eby'okubateeza entsibo, ebitaanuukaine n'enyegyesa ei mwayegire; mubeetantare; <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:19">Fil 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:4">Kol 2:4</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba abari nk'abo tibaheereza Mukama waitu Kristo, kureka enda zaabo bonka; kandi emitima y'abataine bugobya bagibeihabeihesa okugamba gye n'ebigambo by'okuteera ekimama. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:16">Mat 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 14:20">1 Kor 14:20</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba okworoba kwanyu nikumanywa omu bantu boona; nikyo ndikwesiimira ahabwanyu; kwonka niinyenda ngu mube abanyabwengye aha kirungi, kandi abataine buryarya aha kibi; <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:15">Kut 3:15</ref>. </char></note> kandi Ruhanga mukama w'obusingye aryasingyeera Sitaane juba ahansi y'ebigyere byanyu. Embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo zigume naimwe. <verse eid="ROM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoseo, omukozi mugyenzi wangye, yaabaramutsya; kandi Lukio, Yasooni na Sosipateeri ab'omuryango gwangye nabo baabaramutsya. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Nyowe Teretio, omuhandiiki w'ebaruha egi, nimbaramutsya omuri Mukama. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:14">1 Kor 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Gaayo orikundaaza, n'ekanisa yoona baabaramutsya. Erasto, omubiiki w'empiiha z'orurembo, n'ow'eishe-emwe Kwato, baabaramutsya. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo zigume naimwe mwena. Amiina.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:26">Kol 1:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nimbatsigira Ruhanga orikubaasa kubagumya, nk'engiri yangye n'okubuurira ebya Yesu Kristo oku biri, ebirikwikirizana n'enaama eyaashuurwirwe; enaama egyo ekaba esherekirwe okuruga iranaira, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:5">Rom 1:5</ref>. </char></note> kwonka hati eshuurwirwe, kandi yaamanyisibwa aha mahanga goona omu byahandiikirwe baanabi, nka Ruhanga otahwaho oku yaaragiire, ngu amahanga ago gabone kumwikiriza n'okumworobera. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Ruhanga ow'obwengye omwe wenka aheebwe ekitiinisa ebiro byona ahabwa Yesu Kristo. Amiina.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>